DATASET ATTRIBUTION & MODIFICATION NOTICE (CC BY 4.0):
The derived CVM ROI images in `Aariz_CVM_Clean/` are adapted from the Aariz
Cephalometric Dataset (Khalid et al., Figshare, DOI: 10.6084/m9.figshare.22186789 /
10.6084/m9.figshare.27986417.v1), licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC BY 4.0).
Modifications made: Cervical vertebrae (C2-C4) region-of-interest (ROI) cropping
to 512x512 resolution and quality filtering/cleaning across 6 CVM stages
(637 radiographs redistributed under CC BY 4.0).
